{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"职级体系与薪酬","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/level-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-level-system","title":"Costco 职级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/level-and-compensation/career-level-system","wordCount":1535,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"Costco 薪酬结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-evaluation","title":"Costco 绩效考核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation","wordCount":1620,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"workplace-survival-guide","title":"Costco 职场生存指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide","wordCount":1922,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"职级体系与薪酬\">职级体系与薪酬</h1><p>本章系统介绍 Costco 的职级体系、薪酬结构、绩效考核机制以及职场生存指南。Costco 以行业领先的薪酬福利和清晰的内部晋升路径著称，93% 的一年以上员工留存率和 90% 以上管理岗位内部提拔的传统，使其成为零售行业雇主品牌的标杆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>职级体系</strong>：从仓储员工到高管层的完整晋升阶梯</li>\n<li><strong>薪酬结构</strong>：行业领先的时薪、年度加薪机制与全面福利体系</li>\n<li><strong>绩效考核</strong>：简单指标导向的评估体系与内部晋升优先政策</li>\n<li><strong>职场生存指南</strong>：仓储轮岗文化、体力要求与晋升实用建议</li>\n</ul>\n"}